            </note>
            <note corresp="#d77-f2" n="2" xml:id="d77-f2-content">
                <p>For text of the President’s statement of April 18, see the Department of State
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, April 30, 1951, p. 699.</p>
